    {
      "id": "b1.situations.practice-renting-pine-street",
      "level": "B1",
      "topics": ["situations"],
      "title": "The apartment on Pine Street",
      "text": "Agent: Hi, are you calling about the apartment on Pine Street? Leo: Yes. Is it still available? Agent: It is. It's a one-bedroom, and it's furnished. Leo: Great. How much is the rent? Agent: It's eleven hundred dollars a month, and utilities are included. The landlord also asks for a security deposit of one month's rent. Leo: And how long is the lease? Agent: You sign a lease for twelve months. Would you like to see the apartment on Saturday? Leo: Sure, Saturday works for me.",
      "source": { "kind": "original" }
    }
  ],
